name: mule_cashout_till_map
title: "Cash-out through one till"
description: "How the money leaves: a second hub account in Marseille funds eight accounts at city branches, and all of them withdraw the cash through one till in Paris. It shows as a converging star beside the scattered ordinary tills in Amsterdam, Rome, Utrecht, Barcelona and Krakow. Route colour shows each account’s role. Synthetic placements."
sourceId: od-routes
display: markers
query:
  routes:
    datasetId: mule_cashout_legs_dataset
    fromLatCol: FROM_LAT
    fromLonCol: FROM_LON
    toLatCol: TO_LAT
    toLonCol: TO_LON
    fromCol: FROM_ACCOUNT
    toCol: TO_ACCOUNT
    kindCol: ROLE
camera:
  center[2]: 6,47
  zoom: 4.5
